  "details": "For people who switch avatars very often, it's hard to memorize all the different gestures each avatar has.\nOn top of that, with the valve index controllers, it's hard to be sure you're actually doing the gesture you think you're doing, as the finger tracking isn't very consistent. This can result in doing dumb faces without realizing it, unless you have a way to check which gesture you're doing. That's where the preview mirror comes in.\nHaving a local mini mirror of your face in the corner of your screen to see your own avatar's face is extremely useful to be able to do correct gestures with any new avatar you switch into without having to memorize those.",
